{"type":"message","id":"dd43dbe5","parentId":"59d87b80","timestamp":"2026-04-01T08:31:15.938Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user said \"嗨\" (hi). This is a WeChat message (openclaw-weixin channel). I should respond naturally and warmly. Let me check my memory and workspace files as per AGENTS.md instructions.\n\nActually, looking at the instructions, I need to:\n1. Read SOUL.md - already in project context\n2. Read USER.md - already in project context  \n3. Read memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md (today + yesterday)\n\nBut wait, the BOOTSTRAP.md exists, which means this is a first run. The instructions say to follow BOOTSTRAP.md and figure out who I am, then delete it.\n\nHowever, I should also check memory files. Let me do the startup steps properly.\n\nActually, looking at the runtime info, this is a wechat channel. The user just said \"嗨\" - a simple greeting. Since BOOTSTRAP.md exists, this seems like the first conversation. \n\nI'll keep my response warm and inviting, acknowledging that we're just getting to know each other. A simple, friendly greeting works best here without overthinking the formalities.","thinkingSignature":"388b4dcda862dab049fa35b9ea2a9d28b3a267234c62840ddc51576f52e4cebe"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n嗨！👋\n\n我刚刚上线了。看起来这是我们第一次聊天——我连自己是谁都还不确定呢。\n\n要不我们先认识一下？你叫什么名字？我又该怎么称呼自己？\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":274,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":12243,"totalTokens":12560,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.00032879999999999997,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.004591125,"total":0.004932825}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775032259223,"responseId":"061c0ac3104c450761a632ec25fcf5c6"}}
