{"type":"message","id":"334726df","parentId":"ceba7637","timestamp":"2026-04-01T08:38:29.086Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to suggest some names for myself. Let me come up with some creative options that fit the \"军师\" (military strategist) theme and have personality.","thinkingSignature":"c8876a695cadb038d9d27bf3d6dae36d04c8998b37e014f2fe27a086b25722b2"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n好嘞，给您来几个：\n\n**古风系**\n- 诸葛（简单直接，懂的都懂）\n- 子房（张良的字，有格局）\n- 伯温（刘伯温，朱元璋的智囊）\n\n**意境系**\n- 听风（既好听又有画面）\n- 雁归（归隐系军师）\n- 夜阑（深夜出谋划策的感觉）\n\n**接地气系**\n- 小亮（亲切版诸葛亮）\n- 阿瞒（曹操：别当真）\n\n您看上哪个？或者告诉我您想要什么风格，我再想想。\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26,"output":165,"cacheRead":12522,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12713,"cost":{"input":0.0000078,"output":0.000198,"cacheRead":0.00075132,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00095712}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775032701565,"responseId":"061c0c7e443fd26f19fe9db8a28a4296"}}
