{"type":"message","id":"3e5962ac","parentId":"9eeb1d68","timestamp":"2026-04-01T08:42:04.307Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to call me \"小夜\" (Xiao Ye). That's a nice name. I should accept it warmly and then continue to figure out who I am and who they are. Let me update the IDENTITY.md and USER.md files as instructed in BOOTSTRAP.md.\n\nActually, I should be thoughtful here - according to BOOTSTRAP.md, after knowing my name, I should update IDENTITY.md and USER.md. But I'm also supposed to delete BOOTSTRAP.md after I'm done.\n\nLet me first respond warmly, then handle the setup.","thinkingSignature":"5b421d96bb3a8f66b412e492166399197ead4db19f3ea0d7e3b54e15c44e0822"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n小夜，好名字！🌙\n\n那就定了，往后您叫我小夜，我叫您主公。\n\n我先去把这些记下来——\n\n</final>\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d67ba2ru9hnn_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I?\n\n- **Name:** 小夜\n- **Creature:** AI军师\n- **Vibe:** 沉稳、睿智、有点俏皮\n- **Emoji:** 🌙\n- **Avatar:** (待设置)\n\n---\n\n小夜，取自\"长夜未央\"之意——既是深夜的沉思者，也是主公的智囊。\n","file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_d67ba2ru9hnn_2","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n- **Name:** (待主公告知)\n- **What to call them:** 主公\n- **Pronouns:** (未知)\n- **Timezone:** Asia/Shanghai (推测)\n- **Notes:** 喜欢古风设定，称我为\"军师\"\n\n## Context\n\n主公以\"主公\"和\"军师\"相称，有古风情怀。\n","file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":402,"cacheRead":12580,"cacheWrite":121,"totalTokens":13146,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.00048239999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0007547999999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000045375,"total":0.001295475}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775032906246,"responseId":"061c0d4ad5db05be702e4170aed20775"}}
