ter saying U.S. may leave war within weeks - NPR\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ac7f4e198f2b6a5a\">>>","url":"https://www.npr.org/2026/04/01/nx-s1-5769805/iran-war-trump","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"05af2f3d0889561a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nAs Israel expands its invasion of Lebanon, the White House says President Trump will provide \"an important update\" to the nation on the Iran war.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"05af2f3d0889561a\">>>","siteName":"www.npr.org"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e1cbdbbfcef77a65\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nLive Updates: Trump addresses nation on Iran war as he predicts ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e1cbdbbfcef77a65\">>>","url":"https://www.cbsnews.com/live-updates/iran-war-trump-nato-tehran-threatens-us-tech-companies-strait-of-hormuz/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"297be89d0de82859\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTrump says he expects the U.S. war with Iran to end within several weeks despite unrelenting attacks from both sides and Iran's iron grip on the Strait of Hormuz.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"297be89d0de82859\">>>","siteName":"www.cbsnews.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c4f33fb048795b95\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTRUMP IRAN SPEECH APRIL 2 2026 LATEST NEWS - The Economic Times\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c4f33fb048795b95\">>>","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/topic/trump-iran-speech-april-2-2026-latest-news/news","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cf021424ecf8c0e0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nSEARCHED FOR: TRUMP IRAN SPEECH APRIL 2 2026 LATEST NEWS Trump announcement today: What to expect from Trump's address to nation on Iran War and when is Trump speaking today - here's the latest update Trump announcement today: President Trump is set to address the nation amid the ongoing US- Iran conflict, now in its second month.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cf021424ecf8c0e0\">>>","siteName":"economictimes.indiatimes.com"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775094294657}}
