n't happen until the opening of the Strait of Hormuz. “Until then, we are blasting Iran into oblivion, or, as they say, back to the Stone Ages!!!\"” Trump said.\nTrump says US may exit Iran war soon: The US will end its war on Iran fairly soon and could return for \"spot hits\" if needed, Trump told news agency Reuters ahead of his speech. He reportedly also said that he would announce the withdrawal of US from the NATO alliance in his speech, a move made over what he sees as its failure to support the Washington in the war.\n\nFollow all the updates here:\n\nApr 02, 2026 7:05:29 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: Donald Trump shared a big update on when the war with Iran could end. He said: \"Thanks to the progress we've made, I can say tonight that we are on-track to complete all of America’s military objectives shortly. We are going to hit them extremely hard over the next two to three weeks... In the meantime, discussions are ongoing.\"\n\nApr 02, 2026 7:01:53 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: US President Donald Trump said that Americans can look forward to a day of being “finally free” of Iranian aggression and nuclear “blackmail”.\n“Because of the actions we have taken, we are on the cusp of ending Iran's sinister threat to America and the world,” Trump said.\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:56:41 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: Issuing a fresh warning to Iran, US President Donald Trump said: “If there is no deal, we are going to hit each and every one of their electric generating plants very hard, and probably simultaneously.”\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:49:06 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: The US President has offered countries facing issues getting fuel to buy oil from the US instead. “We have plenty. We have so much,” Trump said, further suggesting another option: “Build up some delayed courage, should have done it before, should have done it with us, as we asked. Go to the straight and just take it, protect it. Use it for yourselves.\"\nTrump was referring to the blockade of the Strait of Hormuz.\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:45:44 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: Giving a big update on when the war with Iran will end, Trump said: “We are going to finish the job, and we're going to finish it very fast.”\nHe also tanked allies in the Middle East - Israel. Saudi Arabia, Qatar, the UAE, Kuwait, and Bahrain, and said: “They been great, and we will not let them get hurt or fail in any way, shape, or form”.\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:40:58 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: Donald Trump said that he always wanted to opt for a path of diplomacy but Iran continued building its nuclear regime, rejecting all attempts at an agreement. Trump was referring to the US's earlier operation back in June.\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:38:06 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: Donald Trump said: “Iran's navy is gone, their air force is in ruins, its leaders, most of them terrorists, are now dead.”\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:36:19 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE updates: US President Donald Trump heaped praise on the country's armed forces for a “decisive” blow to Iran in the ongoing war.\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:27:05 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE: Ahead of Trump's speech, US Secretary of State Marco Rubio said in an interview that the President won't allow “fake negotiations to be used as a delay tactic” amid the ongoing war with Iran.\n“We'll always be prepared to talk — but we're not going to allow that, or the failure of talks, to impede our ability to defend this country and protect this country from a real threat,” Rubio said in an interview to Fox News.\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:22:56 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE: White House has posted a message with just minutes left for Donald Trump's speech, asking people to tune in.\n“TONIGHT: President Donald J. Trump addresses the nation on Operation Epic Fury. 9 PM EST — don’t miss it,” the White House said. According to India time, the speech will begin at 6:30 am.\n\nApr 02, 2026 6:07:24 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE: Donald Trump said the US would keep “blasting Iran into oblivion or, as they say, back to the Stone Ages!!!” until the Strait of Hormuz is open for operations. Trump said that Iran was willing for a ceasefire but the US would only agree if the key waterway resumes normal operations.\nIran maintains that the Strait of Hormuz is open for all, except its enemies - US and Israel.\n\nApr 02, 2026 5:58:37 AM IST\nTrump's speech on Iran war LIVE: In his rare primetime address on the Iran-US war, Donald \n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2c01ef90a10c6d2e\">>>"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775094301353}}
{"type":"message","id":"d9d7ef78","parentId":"3a24efd2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T01:45:39.442Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have good information to provide a comprehensive summary and analysis. Let me organize the key points.\n\nKey facts:\n1. Trump gave a primetime address on April 1, 2026 (US time) / April 2, 2026 (IST)\n2. It's his first primetime speech about the Iran war\n3. The war is in its 5th week (started Feb 28, 2026)\n4. Main themes:\n   - War will end in 2-3 weeks\n   - US military objectives are \"nearing completion\"\n   - \"Iran's navy is gone, air force in ruins, leaders dead\"\n   - Claims diplomacy was attempted but Iran rejected\n   - Threatens to hit Iran's electric generating plants if no deal\n   - Praised allies: Israel, Saudi Arabia, UAE, Qatar, Kuwait, Bahrain\n   - Oil prices at ~$100/barrel, gas at $4.06/gallon\n   - Hints at NATO withdrawal announcement\n5. What's NOT mentioned:\n   - No mention of ground troops (US has Marines amassing)\n   - No mention of negotiations (though Trump claims they're ongoing)\n6. Iran denies negotiations, calls US demands \"maximalist and irrational\"\n\nLet me write this up in Chinese for Lucifer.","thinkingSignature":"ee83b25ed5ecd5ae90e4ca0ed65335448e0e7b32bb9096ce6129df61dc18287e"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n主公，这是小夜为您整理的特朗普伊战讲话总结与分析：\n\n---\n\n## 📺 讲话基本信息\n\n**时间**：2026年4月1日晚间（美东时间9点）\\\n**背景**：美伊开战的第5周，特朗普首次就此发表黄金时段全国讲话\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 核心内容\n\n**战局判断**\n- 美军\"接近完成\"所有核心军事目标\n- 声称伊朗海军已全军覆没，空军\"废墟化\"，领导人\"大部分已死\"\n- 战争预计再持续**2-3周**后结束\n\n**威胁信号**\n- 若伊朗不就范，将\"全面、同时\"打击伊朗所有**发电厂**\n- 在霍尔木兹海峡重新开放前，继续\"把伊朗炸回石器时代\"\n\n**外交叙事**\n- 坚称始终选择外交途径，但伊朗\"拒绝了所有协议提议\"\n- 同时威胁不允许\"假谈判\"作为拖延战术\n\n**石油策略**\n- 喊话各国：买美国石油，\"我们有很多\"\n- 暗示盟友可组队\"夺取\"霍尔木兹海峡\n\n**盟友承诺**\n- 盛赞以色列、沙特、阿联酋、卡塔尔、科威特、巴林\n- 承诺\"不会让它们受损\"\n\n**额外爆料**（路透社提前披露）\n- 特朗普暗示将在讲话中宣布**退出北约**，理由是北约未能支持美国在伊战中的立场\n\n---\n\n## ❌ 讲话中**没**说的话\n\n| 未提及 | 背景 |\n|--------|------|\n| 地面部队计划 | 美国正在集结海军陆战队，但特朗普只字未提是否动用 |\n| 谈判细节 | 虽声称谈判在进行，但未提供任何具体方案 |\n| 政权更迭目标 | 明确否认\"政权更迭\"是目标 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 分析\n\n**1. 选举年叙事**\n战争持续推高油价（~$100/桶）和美国油价（$4.06/加仑），特朗普面临压力，需要对内展示\"即将胜利\"以稳住选民。\n\n**2. \"赢学\"定调**\n这是典型的特朗普式讲话——强调胜利、威胁升级、盟友表忠心。但现实是霍尔木兹海峡仍被封锁，伊朗并未跪地求饶（伊朗官方否认谈判，指责美方要求\"极端且不理性\"）。\n\n**3. 北约烟雾弹**\n暗示退北约是分散注意力+对盟友施压的组合拳，实际执行概率存疑。\n\n**4. 油价博弈**\n美国已是石油净出口国，高油价对其国内有政治代价，但对其能源巨头却是利好。\n\n---\n\n**一句话总结**：特朗普在给战争\"打包票胜利\"，但真实结局——谈判桌还是坟墓——仍未揭晓。\n\n---\n\n*新闻来源：Reuters、CNBC、Hindustan Times、Politico、CBS News等*\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9900,"output":862,"cacheRead":12182,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22944,"cost":{"input":0.00297,"output":0.0010344,"cacheRead":0.0007309199999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0047353199999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775094301369,"responseId":"061cfd1db6859a5aa7e9dc9c289fdf7e"}}
